      "text_unit_id": "tu_0002",
      "verbatim_text": "Participation in high-intensity exercise and all competitive sports, if desired, with the exception where syncope may cause serious harm or death, may be considered in asymptomatic individuals with LVNC and LVEF ≥ 50% and absence of frequent and/or complex VAs."
